    "body": "@jyavenard I'm not familiar with MP4, but I was thinking about the kind of situation described in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/360#issuecomment-159860979 where using the keyframe index in the header only allows you to make a pessimistic estimate, because \"tedious inspection\" would be needed to figure out where the audio samples and non-keyframe video samples are, and thus precisely how much you could play.\n\nIn any case, I don't think that anyone will ever do that tedious inspection when a keyframe index or similar is available.\n",
